     source_name, source_url, license)
  select 'Corn Bread (Lombardy)', 'Boil 200 g of water and pour it over the cornmeal in a bowl; mix well with a fork and let it cool to room temperature.
Add the sourdough, wheat flour, salt and the rest of the water; knead until smooth. Cover with a towel and let rise for about 8 hours.
