  select 'Deep Fried Chickpea Dough Balls (Chyueeam)', 'Soak kadalai paruppu in clean water for at least 8 hours. They will double in size, so allow extra water for them to soak up.
Boil kadalai paruppu. This should take about 40 minutes in a regular pot on the stove, or about 9 minutes in a pressure cooker (plus 10 minutes to depressurise).
