    (title, instructions, cuisine, status, author_id,
     source_name, source_url, license)
  select 'Ekuru (White Bean Pudding)', 'Soak the beans for 10 minutes in cold water to loosen the skins. Remove the skins and discard them. The time you need to soak the beans properly depends on the type of beans you are using and how dry they are. You may need to soak for longer.
Blend the peeled beans to a smooth paste.
