     source_name, source_url, license)
  select 'Gambian Yassa Poulet', 'In a mixing bowl, combine the thinly sliced onions, minced garlic, grated ginger, lemon juice, olive oil, Dijon mustard, black pepper, and a pinch of salt. Mix well to create a marinade.
Add the chicken pieces to the marinade, ensuring they are evenly coated. Cover the bowl and let the chicken marinate in the refrigerator for at least 2 hours, but preferably overnight, to allow the flavors to meld.
